WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.153
The four panels are separate checks Being competent does

00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:08.600
not create authority Having system access does not prove

00:00:08.666 --> 00:00:11.863
that the information is reliable or that enough capacity

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:12.705
is available

00:00:13.527 --> 00:00:16.843
The record links a result to its scope conditions

00:00:17.224 --> 00:00:22.053
decision route evidence and review point This makes limits

00:00:22.053 --> 00:00:24.592
visible before the assistant accepts the work

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.736
The cards distinguish an individual account from an approved

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:33.236
delegation Approved delegated access is not the same as

00:00:33.263 --> 00:00:38.328
sharing another person’s password Use the organisation’s actual access

00:00:38.381 --> 00:00:39.078
controls
